Samson and Jasper Ridge measurements and benchmark references are downloaded from
gaetanosettembre/data_unmixing at a fixed revision. That research repository includes
a GPL-3.0 license and specifies research/educational use with respect for original
dataset terms. Raw MATLAB data are not redistributed here. Follow the providers'
terms for data access and downstream reuse.

The attributed real-scene figures and estimated arrays are derived from those data.
They do not transfer ownership of the underlying measurements or annotations.
Exact source URLs, hashes and citations are in configs/sources.json and
docs/references.md. Real-scene references are estimates, not field-measured fractions.

Synthetic mixtures are generated analytically by this project's code, rather than
recorded by a real sensor or taken from a measured mineral spectral library.
